{"speciesId":38,"names":{"fr":"Feunard","es":"Ninetales","en":"Ninetales","ja":"キュウコン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"red","text":"Very smart and very vengeful. Grabbing one of its many tails could result in a 1000-year curse."},{"language":"en","version":"blue","text":"Very smart and very vengeful. Grabbing one of its many tails could result in a 1000-year curse."},{"language":"en","version":"yellow","text":"According to an enduring legend, 9 noble saints were united and reincarnated as this POKéMON."},{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"Some legends claim that each of its nine tails has its own unique type of special mystical power."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"Its nine beautiful tails are filled with a wondrous energy that could keep it alive for 1,000 years."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"It is said to live a thousand years, and each of its tails is loaded with supernatural powers."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"NINETALES casts a sinister light from its bright red eyes to gain total control over its foe’s mind. This POKéMON is said to live for a thousand years."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"Legend has it that NINETALES came into being when nine wizards possessing sacred powers merged into one. This POKéMON is highly intelligent - it can understand human speech."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It has long been said that each of the nine tails embody an enchanted power. A long-lived NINETALES will have fur that shines like gold."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It has nine long tails and fur that gleams gold. It is said to live for 1,000 years."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"Very smart and very vengeful. Grabbing one of its many tails could result in a 1,000-year curse."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Its nine tails are said to be imbued with a mystic power. It can live for a thousand years."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Its nine tails are said to be imbued with a mystic power. It can live for a thousand years."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Its nine tails are said to be imbued with a mystic power. It can live for a thousand years."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Some legends claim that each of its nine tails has its own unique type of special mystical power."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Its nine beautiful tails are filled with a wondrous energy that could keep it alive for 1,000 years."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"On raconte que ses neuf queues détiennent un pouvoir mystique. Il peut vivre pendant mille ans."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Its nine tails are said to be imbued with a mystic power. It can live for a thousand years."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"On raconte que ses neuf queues détiennent un pouvoir mystique. Il peut vivre pendant mille ans."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Its nine tails are said to be imbued with a mystic power. It can live for a thousand years."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Each of its nine tails is imbued with supernatural power, and it can live for a thousand years."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Each of its nine tails is imbued with supernatural power, and it can live for a thousand years."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il a neuf longues queues et une fourrure qui brille comme de l’or. On dit qu’il peut vivre 1 000 ans."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Tiene nueve colas y un pelaje de color dorado. Dicen que este Pokémon llega a vivir 1000 años."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It has nine long tails and fur that gleams gold. It is said to live for 1,000 years."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"黄金に 輝く 体毛と ９本の 長い 尻尾を 持つ。 １０００年は 生きると 言われる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il est très intelligent et rancunier. Attrapez une de ses queues et il vous maudira pour 1 000 ans."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Muy inteligente y vengativo. Agarrar una de sus colas podría traer 1000 años de mala suerte."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Very smart and very vengeful. Grabbing one of its many tails could result in a 1,000-year curse."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"頭が良くて 執念深い。 ふざけて 尻尾を つかむと １０００年 たたられるという。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Feunard peut envoyer un inquiétant rayon avec ses yeux rouge vif pour prendre le contrôle de l’esprit de son ennemi. On raconte que ce Pokémon peut vivre 1 000 ans."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Ninetales emite una siniestra luz a través de los brillantes ojos rojos que tiene, para conseguir controlar del todo la mente de su rival. Dicen que este Pokémon llega a vivir mil años."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Ninetales casts a sinister light from its bright red eyes to gain total control over its foe’s mind. This Pokémon is said to live for a thousand years."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"真っ赤な 瞳は 怪しい 光を 放ち 相手の 心を 自在に 操る。 １０００年間 生きると いわれている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"La légende raconte que Feunard est apparu lorsque neuf sorciers aux pouvoirs sacrés décidèrent de fusionner. Ce Pokémon est très intelligent. Il comprend la langue des hommes."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Cuenta la leyenda que Ninetales nació de la fusión de nueve hechiceros que tenían poderes sagrados. Este Pokémon es realmente inteligente. Entiende el lenguaje humano."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Legend has it that Ninetales came into being when nine wizards possessing sacred powers merged into one. This Pokémon is highly intelligent—it can understand human speech."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"９人の 聖なる 力を 持った 仙人が 合体して 生まれたという 伝説が ある。 知能が 高く 人の 言葉を 理解する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"L’aura mystique de ce Pokémon est telle qu’une légende raconte que neuf grands sages ont un jour fusionné pour devenir un Feunard."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Siempre se le ha considerado un Pokémon místico. Una leyenda asegura que se originó a partir de la unión de nueve deidades."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"Legend has it that this mystical Pokémon was formed when nine saints coalesced into one."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"９人の 聖者が 合体し キュウコンに なったという 伝説も 残るほど 神秘に満ちた ポケモン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"On raconte que ce Pokémon vit 1 000 ans. Ses pouvoirs lui permettent de contrôler les flammes à volonté pour griller ses proies."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Se dice que este Pokémon llega a vivir mil años. Con sus poderes, es capaz de controlar el fuego a voluntad y calcinar a sus presas."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"Said to live for a thousand years, this Pokémon uses its supernatural abilities to manipulate fire. It can burn its prey to a crisp as it pleases."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"１０００年 生きると いわれている。 神通力で 火炎を 自在に 操り 獲物を 焼き焦がす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Un Pokémon très rancunier. S’il est offensé, son ressentiment peut poursuivre le coupable et sa descendance pendant un millénaire."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Un Pokémon extraordinariamente vengativo. Si recibe una afrenta, su rencor puede perdurar durante un milenio y trascender generaciones."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It is vindictive and relentless by nature. Those who cross it even once will be cursed for a thousand years, along with their descendants."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"しつこく 執念深い 性質。 １度 恨むと 子孫を 含め １０００年間 祟り続ける。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Un Pokémon extrêmement intelligent qui crache des flammes vacillantes pour hypnotiser et capturer ses proies."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Este Pokémon es sumamente inteligente. Controla las llamas que expele por la boca para hipnotizar y capturar a sus presas."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"The flickering flames it spews from its mouth leave its opponents hypnotized. Then, this extremely intelligent Pokémon attacks."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"口から 吹いた 揺らめく 炎で 催眠 状態にして 獲物を 襲う 非常に 賢いポケモン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Selon la légende, neuf sages se sont unis et incarnés dans ce Pokémon mystique."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"De acuerdo con una antigua leyenda, este Pokémon es la reencarnación de nueve deidades que se unieron en un solo ser."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"According to an enduring legend, nine noble saints were united and reincarnated as this Pokémon."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"９人の 聖者が 合体して このポケモンに 生まれかわったと 言い伝えに 残っている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Selon la légende, neuf sages se sont unis et incarnés dans ce Pokémon mystique."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"De acuerdo con una antigua leyenda, este Pokémon es la reencarnación de nueve deidades que se unieron en un solo ser."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"According to an enduring legend, nine noble saints were united and reincarnated as this Pokémon."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"９人の 聖者が 合体して このポケモンに 生まれかわったと 言い伝えに 残っている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"On dit qu’il vit 1 000 ans et que chacune de ses queues a un pouvoir magique."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Cuentan que llega a vivir hasta mil años y que cada una de las colas posee poderes sobrenaturales."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It is said to live 1,000 years, and each of its tails is loaded with supernatural powers."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"しっぽの １本 １本に 神通力が 込められている。 １０００年 生きると 言われる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield